            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            style="grid-column-start: 2; grid-column-end: 2; grid-row-start: 1; grid-row-end: 2;"
          >
            <div
              style="margin: 2em; text-align: center; font-size: clamp(14px, 2vw, 36px); align-items: center; overflow-wrap: anywhere;"
            >
              Chronology of Solar Panels
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          style="margin-left: 5em; margin-top: 2em; padding: 5px; font-size: 24px; width: 38%; color: black; background-color: white;"
        >
          In 1964 NASA, building upon previous inventions dating back to earlier than 1873, launched a satellite self-sufficient from solar power. In 1983 Prof. Martin Green of UNSW invented technology that is present in more than 90% of solar panels.
          <br />
          <br />
          In the 2000's
          Japan's mainstream electronics corporations such as Mitsubishi and their peers manufactured a large portion of the solar panels used in residential early adapter regions such as Los Angeles. This marketshare tapered off around 2019, when manufacturing moved mostly to the USA and China. Now, the top 5 countries using residential solar power are United States of America, Japan, China, Australia and India. The U.S.A. produced more than 50% of their electricity in their grid from solar panels in 2023.
        </div>
        <div
          popover="manual"
          style="text-align: center; border: 2px solid grey; background-color: white; color: black; border-radius: 2em; padding: 3em 1em 1em; box-shadow: 12px 21px black; height: 200px; width: 265px; z-index: 999; position: fixed; right: 40px; bottom: 200px;"
        >
          <h2>
            Get in touch!
          </h2>
          <button
            style="border: 3px solid blue; background-color: lightblue; border-radius: 1em; width: 100%;"
          >
            Send an email
          </button>
        </div>
        <div
          style="position: fixed; right: 40px; bottom: 40px; background: white; border: 2px solid black; cursor: pointer; z-index: 100;"
        >
          <img
            alt="Contact Us Window Pop-up Button Gif of Typewriter Cartoon"
            height="60"
            src="/src/assets/ContactUs.gif"
            width="100"
          />
        </div>
        <div
          style="margin: 2em; text-align: center; font-size: clamp(14px, 2vw, 36px); align-items: center; overflow-wrap: anywhere;"
        >
          Solar Panels Manufacturing Locations Distances Greater Than 2,000 Miles of Clients
        </div>
        <div
          style="margin: 2em 0px 0px 1.5em; padding-right: 1.5em; font-size: clamp(12px, 1vw, 20px); overflow-wrap: anywhere;"
        >
          <button>
            Sort Ascending
          </button>
          <button>
            Sort Descending
          </button>
          <div>
            <div
              style="margin: 2em; text-align: center; font-size: clamp(14px, 2vw, 36px); align-items: center; overflow-wrap: anywhere;"
            >
              Awaiting data for manufacturing distances...
            </div>
            No error
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          style="margin: 2em; text-align: center; font-size: clamp(14px, 2vw, 36px); align-items: center; overflow-wrap: anywhere;"
        >
          Residental Solar Panel Periods of Continued Growth
        </div>
        <div
          style="margin: auto; padding: 3em; display: flex; position: relative; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: nowrap; justify-content: center; width: 70%; background-color: white;"
        >
          <div
            class="recharts-wrapper"
            style="position: relative; cursor: default; width: 100%; max-width: 700px; max-height: 70vh; aspect-ratio: 1.618 / 1;"
            width="100%"
          />
        </div>
        <div
          style="margin: 2em; text-align: center; font-size: clamp(14px, 2vw, 36px); align-items: center; overflow-wrap: anywhere;"
        >
          Percentage of World Population By Age - Present Day - 
        </div>
        <div
          style="margin: 2em; text-align: center; font-size: clamp(14px, 2vw, 36px); align-items: center; overflow-wrap: anywhere;"
        >
          Who Will Consume More Than 65% of Their Electricity From Solar Power
        </div>
        <div
          style="margin: auto; padding: 3em; display: flex; position: relative; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: nowrap; justify-content: center; width: 70%;"
        >
          <div
            class="recharts-wrapper"
            style="position: relative; cursor: default; width: 100%; max-width: 700px; max-height: 70vh; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;"
            width="100%"
          />
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
